{"id":"2191f28be68a0b41","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-unital-star-subalgebra.md","title":"固定 Hilbert 结构的含幺星子代数","display":"df-unital-star-subalgebra — 固定 Hilbert 结构的含幺星子代数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-unital-star-subalgebra","aliases":["58-df-unital-star-subalgebra"],"display":"df-unital-star-subalgebra — 固定 Hilbert 结构的含幺星子代数","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-commutant.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-unital-star-subalgebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-unital-star-subalgebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unital-star-subalgebra — 固定 Hilbert 结构的含幺星子代数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ad624e4e75f394b\" href=\"?note=2ad624e4e75f394b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-commutant.md\">../batch19/58-df-commutant.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定复 Hilbert 数据 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\\)</span>；结构属于上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。同一载体的不同 Hilbert 结构不混用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(x,y)\">\\(B(x,y)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+y=+_H(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(x+y=+_H(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ax=\\odot_H(\\langle a,x\\rangle)\">\\(ax=\\odot_H(\\langle a,x\\rangle)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(x)=\\sqrt{B(x,x)}\">\\(\\nu(x)=\\sqrt{B(x,x)}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"aT+bS=\\{\\langle x,aT(x)+bS(x)\\rangle:x\\in H\\}\">\\(aT+bS=\\{\\langle x,aT(x)+bS(x)\\rangle:x\\in H\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_H=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in H\\}\">\\(I_H=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in H\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(H)=B(H)\">\\(\\mathcal B(H)=B(H)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdjointGraph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AdjointGraph}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UnitalStarSubalgebra}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{UnitalStarSubalgebra}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|T\\|\">\\(\\|T\\|\\)</span> 在下式定义；含幺星子代数不预先要求范数闭。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}operator\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathcal B(H)\\coloneqq\\{T\\in H^H:\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;H,\\nu,+_H,\\odot_H;H,\\nu,+_H,\\odot_H;\\mathbb C)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}operator\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathcal B(H)\\coloneqq\\{T\\in H^H:\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;H,\\nu,+_H,\\odot_H;H,\\nu,+_H,\\odot_H;\\mathbb C)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdjointGraph}_S(S,T,H)\\leftrightarrow\nS,T\\in\\mathcal B(H)\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;(B(T(x),y)=B(x,S(y))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adjoint\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdjointGraph}_S(S,T,H)\\leftrightarrow\nS,T\\in\\mathcal B(H)\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;(B(T(x),y)=B(x,S(y))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unital\\text{-}star\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{UnitalStarSubalgebra}_S(A,H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;A\\subseteq\\mathcal B(H)\\land I_H\\in A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall T,S\\in A\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\;(aT+bS\\in A\\land T\\circ S\\in A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall T\\in A\\;\\exists S\\in A\\;\\mathrm{AdjointGraph}_S(S,T,H).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unital\\text{-}star\\text{-}subalgebra}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{UnitalStarSubalgebra}_S(A,H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;A\\subseteq\\mathcal B(H)\\land I_H\\in A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall T,S\\in A\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\;(aT+bS\\in A\\land T\\circ S\\in A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall T\\in A\\;\\exists S\\in A\\;\\mathrm{AdjointGraph}_S(S,T,H).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}commutant}\\vdash\nA&#39;\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathcal B(H):\\forall S\\in A\\;(T\\circ S=S\\circ T)\\},\\qquad\nA&#39;&#39;\\coloneqq(A&#39;)&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}commutant}\\vdash\nA&#39;\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathcal B(H):\\forall S\\in A\\;(T\\circ S=S\\circ T)\\},\\qquad\nA&#39;&#39;\\coloneqq(A&#39;)&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}operator\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\n\\|T\\|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{OpNorm}(T;H,\\nu,H,\\nu)\\quad(T\\in\\mathcal B(H)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}operator\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\n\\|T\\|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{OpNorm}(T;H,\\nu,H,\\nu)\\quad(T\\in\\mathcal B(H)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>二参数 UnitalStarSubalgebra_S 是在明确指定的 Hilbert 上下文 S 中使用的既有接口。没有把它改成在每次调用中任选一个 Hilbert 结构的性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-commutant.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad624e4e75f394b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-d