mmutant}\\vdash\nA'\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathcal B(H):\\forall S\\in A\\;(T\\circ S=S\\circ T)\\},\\qquad\nA''\\coloneqq(A')'.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}operator\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\n\\|T\\|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{OpNorm}(T;H,\\nu,H,\\nu)\\quad(T\\in\\mathcal B(H)).","display":true}],"bytes":2352,"backlinks":[{"id":"ef593f4bf65d6fd1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})$。$\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)$、$\\operatorname{UnitalStarSubalgebra}_S(A,\\mathcal H)$、$A'$、$A''$ 与算子范数 $\\|T\\|$ 使用 [[./58-df-unital-star-subalgebra.md]] 的同一 Hilbert 结构。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1352","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-unital-star-subalgebra.md|58-df-unital-star-subalgebra]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["b70ce791d5b1a19b","2ad9c248fe18df37","2ad624e4e75f394b"]}